---
const siteUrl = Astro.site ?? new URL("https://ednaatelier.com");
const cookiesUrl = new URL("/cookies", siteUrl);
const privacyUrl = new URL("/privacidad", siteUrl);
---

<aside
  data-cookie-banner
  aria-label="Preferencias de cookies"
  aria-describedby="cookie-description"
  class="glass-float fixed inset-x-3 bottom-3 z-50 rounded-3xl p-4 sm:inset-x-auto sm:bottom-5 sm:left-5 sm:max-w-md sm:p-5"
>
  <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
    <h2 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-ink">Tu privacidad en EDNA ATELIER</h2>
    <span class="glass-pill rounded-full px-2.5 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-clay-dark">
      Cookies
    </span>
  </div>

  <p id="cookie-description" class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink/85">
    Usamos almacenamiento técnico esencial para tu carrito. Puedes aceptar todas o quedarte solo con las necesarias.
    Consulta la <a class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-clay-dark" href={cookiesUrl}>Política de Cookies</a>
    y la <a class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-clay-dark" href={privacyUrl}>Política de Privacidad</a>.
  </p>

  <div data-cookie-settings hidden class="mt-3 space-y-2 rounded-2xl border border-white/70 bg-white/60 p-3 text-sm">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2">
      <span class="font-medium text-ink">Esenciales (carrito y seguridad)</span>
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-clay-dark">Siempre activas</span>
    </div>
    <label class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2">
      <span class="text-ink/85">Analítica y rendimiento</span>
      <input data-cookie-analytics type="checkbox" class="h-5 w-5 accent-[#d8ff3e]" />
    </label>
    <label class="flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-2">
      <span class="text-ink/85">Personalización y remates</span>
      <input data-cookie-marketing type="checkbox" class="h-5 w-5 accent-[#d8ff3e]" />
    </label>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
    <button data-cookie-accept-all type="button" class="btn-primary min-h-11 flex-1 !px-4 !py-2 text-sm">
      Aceptar todas
    </button>
    <button data-cookie-save type="button" hidden class="btn-outline min-h-11 flex-1 !px-4 !py-2 text-sm">
      Guardar selección
    </button>
    <button
      data-cookie-necessary
      type="button"
      class="btn-outline min-h-11 !px-4 !py-2 text-sm"
    >
      Solo necesarias
    </button>
    <button
      data-cookie-configure
      type="button"
      aria-expanded="false"
      class="min-h-11 px-3 text-sm font-semibold text-ink underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-clay-dark"
    >
      Configurar
    </button>
  </div>
</aside>
<p data-cookie-status class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></p>
